00:34:00.250 --> 00:34:01.670
So that's how it is.

00:34:01.790 --> 00:34:03.310
Hm hm.

00:34:25.520 --> 00:34:25.780
Hm?

00:34:26.780 --> 00:34:27.040
Nice.

00:34:42.090 --> 00:34:42.830
Then I'll go do my job.

00:34:43.910 --> 00:34:45.310
Then I'll go see my mom.

00:35:16.440 --> 00:35:19.020
The number of robots has been increasing.

00:35:19.760 --> 00:35:29.460
This is a slave circuit that will be installed on all robots in the future.

00:35:31.610 --> 00:35:38.110
If the law is revoked, the robot industry will regain its health again.

00:36:12.540 --> 00:36:14.760
Welcome, Mr. Oldman.

00:36:15.980 --> 00:36:18.270
What's going on? Where's my daughter?

00:36:19.640 --> 00:36:22.550
Well, calm down. She's fine as it is.

00:36:23.110 --> 00:36:28.950
Yoko, why did you do this?

00:36:30.350 --> 00:36:32.410
I'd like you to oppose the robot protection law.

00:36:32.850 --> 00:36:33.370
What?

00:36:33.700 --> 00:36:35.510
The reason is...

00:36:35.510 --> 00:36:36.010
Yes.

00:36:36.370 --> 00:36:38.110
If you call me like this, will you understand?

00:36:41.650 --> 00:36:43.430
Los Silibus.

00:36:43.470 --> 00:36:43.770
Why?

00:36:49.010 --> 00:36:50.730
You seem to be a fast drinker.

00:36:50.970 --> 00:36:52.710
If you pass the opposition vote,

00:36:53.570 --> 00:36:55.180
I'll return your cute daughter safely.

00:36:56.180 --> 00:36:58.520
If you don't do as I say...

00:37:00.700 --> 00:37:02.020
It's all up to you.

00:37:02.440 --> 00:37:06.250
The robot protection law Chicago Summit.

00:37:06.490 --> 00:37:07.490
It's finally time to decide.

00:37:08.030 --> 00:37:09.930
We'll broadcast from the summit venue.

00:37:11.130 --> 00:37:24.520
If you agree with the robot protection law, you may leave.

00:37:24.940 --> 00:37:27.700
I see.

00:37:31.630 --> 00:37:32.710
President Kasei is so persistent.

00:37:33.350 --> 00:37:36.090
All the foreign leaders are against.

00:37:36.880 --> 00:37:38.980
New bills are being matrices again.

00:37:39.100 --> 00:37:44.230
No, I'm not becoming a member.

00:37:44.800 --> 00:37:59.060
Three foreign leaders are against.

00:38:01.240 --> 00:38:04.090
I was bullied.

00:38:04.610 --> 00:38:17.700
I'll forgive you, Kento.

00:39:00.250 --> 00:39:06.660
Is it not enough? Or is the ability of the subject a god's domain?

00:39:07.380 --> 00:39:15.810
Julio, do you want my date?

00:39:16.400 --> 00:39:19.800
Julio, do you want my date?

00:39:21.020 --> 00:39:21.420
Yes.

00:39:21.420 --> 00:39:23.850
Do you want my date?

00:39:24.250 --> 00:39:26.500
Then I will deliver the sample date.

00:39:27.480 --> 00:39:29.050
Here is the product order.

00:39:30.160 --> 00:39:31.220
Please use the mouse robot service.

00:39:31.680 --> 00:39:33.100
The password is...

00:39:33.100 --> 00:39:36.400
Jouhouya, huh?

00:39:36.910 --> 00:39:37.290
Interesting.

00:39:37.830 --> 00:39:55.620
Hehehe.

00:39:55.760 --> 00:39:56.500
That's true.

00:39:56.880 --> 00:39:59.860
From now on...

00:40:00.060 --> 00:40:01.260
For the mouse robot service.

00:40:02.140 --> 00:40:04.940
Then, the last data.

00:40:05.790 --> 00:40:08.150
Wait, I'll check.

00:40:08.870 --> 00:40:20.460
This is the final data?

00:40:20.920 --> 00:40:24.100
There's no way this is all!

00:40:24.680 --> 00:40:26.100
This is all.

00:40:26.550 --> 00:40:27.790
It should contain the things you want.

00:40:31.470 --> 00:40:32.030
W-What?

00:40:32.440 --> 00:40:34.280
What I want is the user manual.

00:40:38.050 --> 00:40:39.000
What is it?

00:40:39.440 --> 00:40:40.860
Where did you hide it?

00:40:41.520 --> 00:40:42.420
I don't know that kind of data.

00:40:43.000 --> 00:40:44.880
If it's in there, I can't update it.

00:40:46.280 --> 00:40:48.630
Anyway, I gave it all to you.

00:40:48.730 --> 00:40:51.410
The reason I can't analyze it is because your system is old.

00:40:52.490 --> 00:40:53.390
Don't be silly!

00:40:54.140 --> 00:40:55.800
This data alone won't complete the user manual.

00:40:57.900 --> 00:40:59.480
That's not true.

00:41:00.280 --> 00:41:03.340
I can't do the exact same thing with my heart.

00:41:03.380 --> 00:41:05.320
It's weird.

00:41:07.460 --> 00:41:15.000
Don't give me that kind of information.

00:41:15.680 --> 00:41:16.760
What do you mean by information?

00:42:02.740 --> 00:42:06.460
99% of them look the same, but they're missing the most important parts.

00:42:07.880 --> 00:42:10.250
Now, give me the rest of the data.

00:42:11.410 --> 00:42:14.080
But, there's no such thing...

00:42:14.630 --> 00:42:16.240
You don't want to see a robot that gives birth to a child?

00:42:18.800 --> 00:42:25.260
There should be a connector somewhere.

00:42:25.680 --> 00:42:27.450
Force the data out of the memory bank.

00:42:36.590 --> 00:42:59.780
What do you think, Gosuwa, my daughter?

00:43:00.000 --> 00:43:04.040
The trash goes to the trash can.

00:43:19.010 --> 00:43:21.710
That bastard!

00:43:22.170 --> 00:43:23.730
He remembered me!

00:43:24.370 --> 00:43:27.400
I'll make him regret it!

00:43:34.250 --> 00:43:35.510
This is the Royal Green Hill Hotel.

00:43:35.510 --> 00:43:37.630
Connect me to a member of the Urban Development Foundation.

00:43:38.290 --> 00:43:39.520
I'm already here.

00:43:40.360 --> 00:43:42.220
Kevin Oldman?

00:43:42.480 --> 00:43:47.160
No, he's not back yet, so he's staying.

00:43:47.800 --> 00:43:50.600
Would you like to say something?

00:43:51.180 --> 00:43:56.020
No, thank you.

00:44:01.050 --> 00:44:01.310
What?

00:44:44.400 --> 00:44:45.020
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:44:45.220 --> 00:44:47.740
What's wrong with the girl?

00:44:48.240 --> 00:44:50.460
You promised to give her back to me.

00:44:51.360 --> 00:44:52.880
Don't worry.

00:44:53.200 --> 00:44:55.710
I'll let you meet your daughter as you promised.

00:44:57.400 --> 00:44:59.150
What a paradise.

00:45:01.440 --> 00:45:02.880
That's what you were going to do from the beginning, weren't you?

00:45:03.180 --> 00:45:12.880
I'm a police officer.

00:45:13.100 --> 00:45:13.420
Former.

00:47:51.180 --> 00:47:52.140
I was happy when Yoko was born.

00:47:54.260 --> 00:47:56.960
She was the happiest girl I've ever had in my life.

00:48:00.120 --> 00:48:06.360
I was worried that you and Yoko would disappear one day.

00:48:07.220 --> 00:48:16.760
I came out silently.

00:48:16.860 --> 00:48:20.200
I really wanted to know the truth.

00:48:21.100 --> 00:48:23.780
I'm a third party, too.

00:48:27.480 --> 00:48:29.260
But I didn't want to get Yoko involved.

00:48:30.000 --> 00:48:33.250
It's the mother of the emperor who became the king.

00:48:33.250 --> 00:48:51.620
Don't try to hold everything in one person.

00:48:51.820 --> 00:48:59.500
Even if you change your name...

00:49:00.600 --> 00:49:06.280
Even if you donate your ID, if you can't escape fate, you should fight.

00:49:08.620 --> 00:49:18.090
Yoko's family is waiting for you.

00:49:18.150 --> 00:49:19.110
Let's go get them.

00:50:05.720 --> 00:50:10.350
I can't confirm the time. If you don't leave within 10 seconds, I'll test your ability.

00:50:11.310 --> 00:50:17.180
10, 9, 6, 5, 4, 3, 2, 1.

00:50:17.180 --> 00:50:19.380
I'm here to pick up the child. Move!

00:50:56.044 --> 00:50:56.544
Oh my-

00:51:00.800 --> 00:51:01.540
I'll take your advice.

00:51:31.950 --> 00:51:32.730
The inside of the car is hidden.

00:51:32.910 --> 00:51:35.060
Sanji.

00:51:35.100 --> 00:51:35.790
Demetrio.

00:51:35.870 --> 00:51:36.050
Yeah.

00:51:47.270 --> 00:51:47.890
Room 49 on the 18th floor.

00:51:48.730 --> 00:51:49.960
It's a research room.

00:51:50.660 --> 00:51:51.770
Good evening.

00:51:53.230 --> 00:51:53.450
Naomi.

00:51:53.630 --> 00:51:55.190
I got in touch with Mars.

00:51:55.250 --> 00:51:57.680
I asked them to prepare a shuttle for a mobile elevator that I don't use now.

00:52:00.000 --> 00:52:02.130
The departure is at 5 a.m. Four hours left.

00:52:03.600 --> 00:52:06.230
Naomi, don't overdo it.

00:52:06.330 --> 00:52:08.710
That guy's aim is my secret.

00:52:09.540 --> 00:52:11.880
I can't get my hands on this body so easily.

00:52:12.850 --> 00:52:15.610
Anyway, don't underestimate it.

00:52:15.830 --> 00:52:18.380
I know.

00:52:32.880 --> 00:52:33.080
Thank you.

00:53:00.380 --> 00:53:02.040
I don't want to see you break any more products.

00:53:02.920 --> 00:53:04.740
Demetrio!

00:53:04.860 --> 00:53:06.320
Let's talk.

00:53:07.060 --> 00:53:09.250
I'll give my daughter back.

00:53:09.250 --> 00:53:10.290
That's all.

00:53:10.450 --> 00:53:12.360
Is it okay to say no?

00:53:13.840 --> 00:53:27.750
I can't get rid of you.

00:53:27.930 --> 00:53:28.790
I'll protect you.

00:53:42.830 --> 00:53:47.050
It's locked. Can't we get it out?

00:53:47.210 --> 00:53:50.920
It's impossible. It's being guarded and the telepresence isn't working.

00:53:51.460 --> 00:53:54.940
Kaliniros, listen carefully. That room is a freezer.

00:53:55.340 --> 00:53:55.580
What?

00:53:56.540 --> 00:53:58.680
Yoko, be careful.

00:54:00.000 --> 00:54:01.860
I'll save you, so do something about it!

00:54:06.960 --> 00:54:17.110
Yeah, yeah, that's fine.

00:54:58.060 --> 00:54:58.860
Let me check your daughter's body.

00:55:00.320 --> 00:55:02.150
I couldn't find a special ability.

00:55:04.190 --> 00:55:05.550
I'm disappointed.

00:55:06.370 --> 00:55:07.910
I'm just a normal kid.

00:55:08.470 --> 00:55:11.720
What did you do to Yoko? Did you hurt her?

00:55:11.940 --> 00:55:14.170
Hurt her?

00:55:14.670 --> 00:55:17.090
I'm not that kind of barbarian.

00:55:17.710 --> 00:55:20.780
I just got a little blood and an organization sample.

00:55:22.860 --> 00:55:24.100
Don't worry.

00:55:24.700 --> 00:55:26.030
I don't need a normal kid.

00:55:44.200 --> 00:55:53.420
I am a great man. I will pour all the great damage and misfortune that you and your wife have caused to my company into the water.

00:55:54.060 --> 00:55:57.960
However, it is up to you to provide me with the secret of S.A.R.D.

00:56:06.590 --> 00:56:07.250
It's a big function.

00:56:07.810 --> 00:56:16.000
A secret? Do you really want to know that much?

00:56:16.180 --> 00:56:21.100
I'll show you right here.

00:56:21.120 --> 00:56:21.440
Really?

00:56:23.060 --> 00:56:27.730
Hold this.

00:56:33.220 --> 00:56:37.550
That's right, that's right.

00:56:37.730 --> 00:56:51.790
You don't seem to know your position.

00:56:53.820 --> 00:56:55.950
I can make you free.

00:56:57.260 --> 00:56:58.910
I'll stop you from saying that.

00:57:00.000 --> 00:57:01.020
I don't want to change my mind.

00:57:02.000 --> 00:57:05.850
If you do that, you will lose your secret forever.

00:57:06.370 --> 00:57:08.030
Stupid man.

00:57:08.250 --> 00:57:12.180
Don't you know where the power to make children lies in women?

00:57:13.470 --> 00:57:13.990
What?

00:57:14.620 --> 00:57:15.380
It's the heart.

00:57:15.780 --> 00:57:18.130
Can you make a child with just your body?

00:57:19.010 --> 00:57:26.090
Friendship.

00:57:27.040 --> 00:57:27.300
Protection.

00:57:28.460 --> 00:57:29.780
That kind of feeling in the future.

00:57:30.030 --> 00:57:32.450
Children can do it to pass it on to others!

00:57:32.590 --> 00:57:44.250
Oh, it's software.

00:58:46.410 --> 00:58:47.090
Thank you for watching.

00:59:32.300 --> 00:59:37.410
I did my best to make this ring. I wanted to give it to Ama.

00:59:37.650 --> 00:59:40.490
I'm sorry.

00:59:40.690 --> 00:59:51.370
What's wrong?

01:00:03.320 --> 01:00:22.520
Naomi...

01:00:34.670 --> 01:00:35.610
Naomi, hurry up!

01:00:35.610 --> 01:00:38.770
Go ahead!

01:00:38.910 --> 01:00:39.190
What?

01:00:39.800 --> 01:00:40.920
I'll stop you here!

01:00:41.260 --> 01:00:41.480
Naomi!

01:01:33.040 --> 01:01:53.140
That Imperial bastard! How dare he do this to my body!

01:01:57.170 --> 01:01:57.910
Hey, hey.

01:01:58.230 --> 01:01:58.610
Again?

01:02:30.220 --> 01:02:31.600
Well, let's see if I can figure it out.

01:03:30.000 --> 01:03:30.900
Looks like this elevator ends here.

01:03:33.120 --> 01:03:34.400
Which one should I ride from here?

01:03:34.700 --> 01:03:43.300
Yoko, don't move!

01:03:44.050 --> 01:03:49.230
How do I know?

01:03:49.410 --> 01:03:57.880
Looks like she won't come down.

01:04:33.230 --> 01:04:33.410
You

01:05:27.130 --> 01:05:28.790
What do you want to do? I'm still on the way.

01:05:30.000 --> 01:05:34.590
Yoko, you're in danger. Please, turn off the limiter in combat mode.

01:05:35.510 --> 01:05:38.410
Wh-What? You know what I mean?

01:05:38.770 --> 01:05:42.420
If you turn off the limiter and enter combat mode, what will happen to your body?

01:05:43.340 --> 01:05:48.600
The power may be different, but the output of the internal battery will exceed the limit,

01:05:48.720 --> 01:05:52.480
and the L-type heat dissipation system built into you will not be able to withstand it.

01:05:53.830 --> 01:05:56.410
Then your proud skin will melt in a few minutes.

01:05:57.550 --> 01:05:59.550
In the end, the body itself will be angry.

01:06:00.000 --> 01:06:01.810
I don't understand! Please!

01:06:06.390 --> 01:06:07.510
I don't care what happens.

01:06:09.140 --> 01:06:16.610
Listen, the password of the limiter release is HEAVEN'S DOOR.

01:06:16.650 --> 01:06:18.470
The door opens in one shot.

01:06:19.110 --> 01:06:21.070
But don't push yourself too hard and go to heaven.

01:06:23.380 --> 01:06:26.430
Well then, let's go.

01:07:12.028 --> 01:07:12.828
Could it be...

01:07:13.212 --> 01:07:15.212
Do you remember everything along the way?

01:07:32.076 --> 01:07:32.836
I didn't need it.

01:07:33.708 --> 01:07:35.708
I didn't know Yoko was such a genius.

01:08:01.148 --> 01:08:02.148
Thank you.

01:08:30.280 --> 01:08:30.500
You

01:09:34.124 --> 01:09:39.124
It's getting interesting! The real show is coming up!

01:09:39.596 --> 01:09:40.596
The main character is...

01:09:40.652 --> 01:09:43.152
It's you, Demetrio.

01:09:43.564 --> 01:09:45.564
Hehehehehehehehehehe

01:09:45.964 --> 01:09:47.964
I have one more favor to ask of you.

01:09:48.332 --> 01:09:50.332
Huh? There's more?

01:09:50.732 --> 01:09:53.532
You copied my memory data, didn't you?

01:09:54.316 --> 01:09:56.556
There's something I want you to do with it.

01:10:03.100 --> 01:10:03.720
I can't eat it.

01:10:04.180 --> 01:10:05.930
Well, I can't say about human.

01:10:06.690 --> 01:10:08.400
Well, let's start.

01:10:09.290 --> 01:10:10.760
It's a show time!

01:10:19.540 --> 01:10:26.830
In MGN, the robbery incident, the so-called first error, was successfully obtained.

01:10:32.460 --> 01:10:40.620
The experiment of the third project and the failure of the project, and the hidden workings of the ERU that failed to be discovered,

01:10:40.620 --> 01:10:42.740
A shocking scene is being shown.

01:10:43.100 --> 01:10:44.880
This new technology is...

01:10:44.880 --> 01:10:46.100
The ERU's top-level...

01:10:46.100 --> 01:10:49.640
You did it, that stupid mouse.

01:11:09.400 --> 01:11:11.560
How about it? Two on one.

01:11:11.960 --> 01:11:14.090
I don't need your help anymore.

01:11:15.030 --> 01:11:17.490
Don't leave Earth alive alone!

01:11:34.060 --> 01:11:34.300
I don't know.

01:12:03.140 --> 01:12:04.260
This kid's gone through!

01:12:32.650 --> 01:12:32.870
Thank you.

01:14:06.460 --> 01:14:06.720
Huh?

01:15:05.532 --> 01:15:06.252
Naomi!

01:15:07.100 --> 01:15:17.100
Please subscribe to my channel and give it a high rating.

01:17:35.240 --> 01:17:42.920
Don't give me a hand!

01:19:28.510 --> 01:19:28.570
Thank you.

01:19:30.060 --> 01:19:30.760
This is the world I've been waiting for.

01:20:04.080 --> 01:20:07.890
Not yet!

01:21:30.892 --> 01:21:31.052
Bye.

01:21:31.980 --> 01:21:32.480
Dang it!

01:22:06.540 --> 01:22:17.280
The license plate is unregistered!

01:22:17.340 --> 01:22:21.500
You must enter this license plate number!

01:22:32.040 --> 01:22:32.420
Do you have permission?

01:22:32.580 --> 01:22:33.440
I don't have permission!

01:22:34.140 --> 01:22:35.850
Give me the control of the cannon!

01:22:36.210 --> 01:22:39.770
I need a license.

01:22:40.800 --> 01:22:42.100
Demetrio Maldini.

01:22:42.300 --> 01:22:43.520
The password is...

01:22:44.560 --> 01:22:46.010
Sign it!

01:22:46.390 --> 01:22:48.510
Roger that.

01:23:02.140 --> 01:23:14.100
Well, why did you come back?

01:23:14.640 --> 01:23:16.650
The landing is complete.

01:23:27.080 --> 01:23:27.300
Why?

01:23:31.500 --> 01:23:35.120
Didn't I tell you? If you touch my daughter, I'll kill you.

01:23:35.870 --> 01:23:38.750
No way... Amiteji...

01:24:05.180 --> 01:24:06.180
Thank you.

01:24:39.720 --> 01:24:45.140
The government has announced that it will implement the Terraforming Zephoria Project, which has been stopped due to numerous problems, even though the plan has already been adopted.

01:24:45.900 --> 01:24:48.750
This is a plan to make an artificial sea by melting the ice on the Mars satellite orbit.

01:29:34.250 --> 01:29:41.050
Jeez, picking it up from the explosion site and repairing it all the way here was a lot of work.

01:29:41.770 --> 01:29:46.920
You're awake, my honey?

01:29:47.520 --> 01:29:48.990
Yes, Master.
